+  <div class="analysis-grid">
+    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="error-title"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="error-title">CONFIDENCE ≠ ACCURACY</h2><span class="micro">DEPTH ERROR / METERS</span></div><canvas id="error-chart" role="img" aria-label="Signed estimate error against assumed plus and minus 1.96 sigma bounds; baseline error is dashed purple if saved." aria-describedby="error-text"></canvas><p id="error-text" class="caption">The white line is actual estimate minus truth. Teal bounds express confidence under the assumed model. Bias or current can push error outside them.</p></section>
